### Unknown signature must be 400 (not found / not confirmed)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/3/vault/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "txSignature": "1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111",
  "bandVaultPda": "6HYhgrjpMZ3C6AS2FYnQv8ofSTqXVyWzRAVq5FoWgYg"
}

### Band 3 vault is still inactive after the rejected confirms
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/3/vault
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
